&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for curious, collaborative Product Design interns to help shape products and experiences that are useful, inspiring, and meaningful for our Pinners. Partnering with mentors and teammates across product, design, engineering, data science, research, and marketing, you’ll help define problems, evaluate opportunities, and drive execution on real product work. You’ll gain hands-on experience balancing user needs, business goals, and technical constraints—while learning how AI-first thinking and AI-powered tools can accelerate product development from idea to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
