&lt;li&gt;Leverage data, user insights, and product judgment to help identify customer needs and inform product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product specs, prioritization, experimentation, and go-to-market planning for scoped initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to optimize your workflow —whether brainstorming, synthesizing insights, drafting product docs, or accelerating execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate new ideas and opinions with candor as you grow both professionally and personally through learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
